"help.message" = "Switch by Power Source uses the discrete GPU on AC power and the integrated GPU on battery. macOS applies the saved settings when your power source changes.\n\nManual modes: Integrated (0), Discrete (1), or Automatic (2). Choosing a manual mode applies it to both power profiles. Choose Switch by Power Source again to restore different modes for AC and battery.\n\nThe menu bar shows the configured policy for the current power source, not GPU usage by every app.\n\nChanging a mode uses the macOS administrator prompt. This app never reads or stores your password.\n\nSome apps or external displays may require the discrete GPU. Actual switching depends on your Mac and macOS.";
